Reading of the diff: the 14 fixture files are byte-identical. index.json differs in exactly one
field, source_engine_commit: the committed index records the commit checked out when it was
generated (5d82623e43697bf47e042e082c2ac4afe28ddc76, the Phase 0 final commit), and a
regeneration at any later HEAD records that later HEAD. That field is provenance, by design;
at a fixed HEAD, regeneration is byte-identical (verified twice in the revision session).
